B.Uj=new A.bc(B.bj,["Wanjiku Mwangi","Nairobi, Kenya","SORA made finding my dream home in Nairobi effortless! Their agents were incredibly helpful and knew the market inside out. Highly recommend to anyone looking for a property in Kenya."],t.l)
B.Uu=new A.bc(B.bj,["James Ouma","Kisumu, Kenya","Selling our family land through SORA was a breeze. The process was transparent, and we got a fantastic offer much faster than we expected. They are the most trusted realtors in Kenya!"],t.l)
B.Ur=new A.bc(B.bj,["Fatuma Ahmed","Mombasa, Kenya","As a first-time land buyer, I was overwhelmed. SORA's patient team and clear process made the journey enjoyable and stress-free. I'm so happy with my plot in the coastal area!"],t.l)
B.Us=new A.bc(B.bj,["David Githinji","Kiambu, Kenya","The property listings on SORA are incredibly detailed and accurate. I found exactly what I was looking for, from a gated community to a bungalow in Kiambu, without any hassle. A truly professional service."],t.l)
B.Uy=new A.bc(B.bj,["Akinyi Odhiambo","Nakuru, Kenya","SORA's local guides provided invaluable insights into the neighbourhoods we were considering. It helped us make a truly informed decision on our investment property. Excellent service!"],t.l)
B.Ul=new A.bc(B.bj,["Peter Kamau","Eldoret, Kenya","I've used several real estate platforms, but SORA stands out with their commitment to excellence and genuine care for their clients. A seamless experience from start to finish."],t.l)
B.Um=new A.bc(B.bj,["Grace Wanjiru","Mirema Drive, Nairobi","We found the perfect townhouse on Mirema Drive through SORA. The location is excellent, and the team ensured a smooth transition. The best real estate agents for properties along Thika Road!"],t.l)
B.Ut=new A.bc(B.bj,["Mwangi wa Macharia","Mirema Drive, Nairobi","SORA's deep knowledge of Mirema Drive properties was a game-changer. They showed us listings that perfectly fit our family's needs and budget. We love our new home!"],t.l)
B.Uz=new A.bc(B.bj,["Emily Muringo","Mirema Drive, Nairobi","The process of acquiring our new commercial space on Mirema Drive was handled with pure professionalism. SORA is the go-to for anyone seeking property in this bustling area."],t.l)
B.Uo=new A.bc(B.bj,["Linet Chege","Westlands, Nairobi","SORA helped us find and furnish the perfect Airbnb apartment in Westlands. Their insights into the short-term rental market are unmatched. Our bookings are through the roof!"],t.l)
B.UA=new A.bc(B.bj,["Sammy Okoth","Kilimani, Nairobi","Investing in an Airbnb unit in Kilimani was a great decision, and it wouldn't have been possible without SORA. They handled everything from identifying the property to tenant management. A top real estate company in Kenya for sure."],t.l)
B.Uv=new A.bc(B.bj,["Chebet Kiprono","Nakuru, Kenya","We were looking for a high-yield rental property in Nakuru. SORA delivered a gem! The team is responsive, and their property management services are fantastic. Thank you for helping us grow our portfolio."],t.l)
B.Uw=new A.bc(B.bj,["Victor Njoroge","Kilimani, Nairobi","I was looking for a modern Airbnb apartment for a short stay. SORA's listings were detailed and the booking process was seamless. The property was exactly as described. So happy with my experience!"],t.l)
B.Un=new A.bc(B.bj,["Monica Moraa","Lavington, Nairobi","The team at SORA truly understands the Airbnb market. They helped me find a property with high rental potential in a prime area like Lavington. My investment is already paying off."],t.l)
B.Ux=new A.bc(B.bj,["Joseph Rotich","Karen, Nairobi","SORA's professional guidance on investing in a luxurious Airbnb villa in Karen was invaluable. They provided all the financial projections and made the entire process transparent and secure."],t.l)
B.Uk=new A.bc(B.bj,["Mercy Adhiambo","Mombasa, Kenya","Our search for a perfect beachfront Airbnb was tough, but SORA made it happen. Their knowledge of the coastal real estate market is incredible. We found a place that our guests adore."],t.l)
B.Uq=new A.bc(B.bj,["Daniel Ochieng","Upper Hill, Nairobi","SORA helped us manage our rental properties efficiently. They are a reliable partner and their team ensures that our properties are always occupied. Top-notch property management in Kenya."],t.l)
B.Up=new A.bc(B.bj,["Faith Wambui","Thika, Kenya","I wanted to diversify my portfolio with a rental property outside Nairobi. SORA gave me excellent advice on the Thika market and helped me secure a fantastic deal. I am a very satisfied client."],t.l)
